:: Cheats Social Children [nobr]

<<set $CheatsSocial to "Children">>

<span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--Child-Aged Characters--</strong></big></span><br>

These buttons will adjust their social score, though you still need to meet them normally to unlock (WIP). <br>

<table style="border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 15px 0;">
    <tr>
        <<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Xavier: Big Brother")>>
            <th>
                <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative;">
                <<if $LeviSocialRank == 1>>
                     <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Pink.png`" style="width: 100px; height: 100px;">
                <<elseif $LeviSocial >= 50>>
                    <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Green.png`" style="width: 100px; height: 100px;">
                <<elseif $LeviSocial > -10 && $LeviSocial < 50>>
                    <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Blue.png`" style="width: 100px; height: 100px;">
                <<elseif $LeviSocial <= -10 && $LeviSocial > -50>>
                    <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Red.png`" style="width: 100px; height: 100px;">
                <<elseif $LeviSocial <= -50>>
                    <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Dark Red.png`" style="width: 100px; height: 100px;">
                <</if>>
                    <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Levi1.png`" style="position: absolute; width: 100px; height: 100px;"> 
                </span>
            </th>
        <<else>>
            <th>
                <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative;">
                    <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Blue.png`" style="width: 100px; height: 100px;">
                    <img @title="_npc" @alt="_npc" @src="`Images/Icons/Social/Unknown.png`" style="position: absolute; width: 100px; height: 100px;"> 
                </span>
            </th>
        <</if>>
        <<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Ben: Track Meet Cute")>>
